msgid ""
"TURBO AND EXTREM OVERCLOCK PRESETS MAY CAUSE SYSTEM UNSTABILITIES, SO USE "
"THEM AT YOUR OWN RISK.\n"
"IF YOU CONTINUE, THE SYSTEM WILL REBOOT NOW."
msgstr ""
"MODURILE DE OVERCLOCK TURBO SI EXTREM POT CAUZA INSTABILITATI DE SISTEM, "
"ASTFEL FOLOSESTE PE PROPRIE RASPUNDERE.\n"
"DACA CONTINUI, SISTEMUL VA REPORNI ACUM."

msgid "Start kodi media player."
msgstr "Porneste Kodi Media Player"

msgid ""
"Select the language for your recalbox, select an external drive to store "
"your games and configurations, check your current version and the free space "
"on your drive"
msgstr ""
"Selecteaza limba pentru recalbox, selecteaza un drive extern pentru a stoc "
"jocuri si configuratii, verifica versiunea curenta si spatiul liber pe drive."

msgid "Shows your current recalboxOS version."
msgstr "Arata versiunea curenta de recalboxOS."

msgid ""
"Show how much space is used on your SHARE partition, located either on the "
"SDCARD or on an external drive. The information shows how many GB are used "
"and how many GB your storage has in total (example 13GB/26GB)."
msgstr ""
"Arata cat spatiu este folosit e partitia ta SHARE, localizata fie pe SDCARD, "
"fie pe un drive extern. Informatia arata cati GB sunt folositi si cati GB "
"are dispozitivul tau in total (exemplu 13GB/26GB)."

msgid ""
"Select an external drive to store your roms, saves, configurations etc.\n"
"Use a FAT32 formatted drive. The system does not format the drive. On first "
"boot, with this option enabled, recalbox will create a '/recalbox' folder "
"with all system files inside."
msgstr ""
"Selectati o unitate externa pentru a stoca romurile, salvarile, "
"configuratiile etc.\n"
"Folositi o unitate formatata FAT32. Sistemul nu formateaza unitatea. La "
"prima pornire, cu aceasta optiune activata, recalbox va crea un folder '/"
"recalbox' cu toate fisierele sistemului in interior."

msgid ""
"Manage your recalbox updates. Select the update type. Activate update check."
msgstr ""
"Gestionati actualizarile recalbox. Selectati tipul de actualizare. Activati "
"verificarea actualizarilor."

msgid "Check if an update is available, and start the update process."
msgstr ""
"Verificati daca este disponibila o actualizare si porniti procesul de "
"actualizare."

msgid ""
"Configure games display, ratio, filters (shaders), auto save and load and "
"retroachievement account."
msgstr ""
"Configurati afisarea jocurilor, raportul, filtrele (shadere), salvarea/"
"incarcarea automata si contul retroachievements."

msgid ""
"The game ratio is the ratio between image width and image height. Use AUTO "
"to let the emulator choose the original game ratio, that will give you the "
"best retrogaming experience."
msgstr ""
"Raportul jocului este raportul dintre latimea si inaltimea imaginii. "
"Folositi AUTO pentru a permite emulatorului sa aleaga raportul original al "
"jocului, care va oferi cea mai buna experienta retrogaming."

msgid ""
"Smooth the game image. This option makes the image smoother, using bilinear "
"filtering."
msgstr ""
"Netezeste imaginea jocului. Aceasta optiune face imaginea mai neteda, "
"folosind filtrare biliniara."

msgid ""
"This option allows you to rewind the game if you get killed by a monster, or "
"if you make any other mistake. Use the HOTKEY + LEFT command within the game "
"to rewind."
msgstr ""
"Aceasta optiune va permite sa derulati inapoi jocul daca sunteti ucis de un "
"monstru sau daca faceti orice alta greseala. Folositi comanda HOTKEY + "
"STANGA in joc pentru a derula inapoi."

msgid ""
"Auto save the state when you quit a game, and auto load last saved state "
"when you start a game."
msgstr ""
"Salveaza automat starea cand iesiti dintr-un joc si incarca automat ultima "
"stare salvata cand porniti un joc."

msgid "Press the buttons twice to end the game and go back to the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Apasati de doua ori butoanele pentru a incheia jocul si a reveni la meniul "
"principal."

msgid ""
"Integer scaling is scaling by a factor of a whole number, such as 2x, 3x, "
"4x, etc. This option scales the image up to the greatest integer scale below "
"the set resolution. So for instance, if you set your fullscreen resolution "
"to 1920x1080 and enable integer scaling, it will only scale a 320x240 image "
"up to 1280x960, and leave black borders all around. This is to maintain a "
"1:1 pixel ratio with the original source image, so that pixels are not "
"unevenly duplicated."
msgstr ""
"Scalarea intreaga este scalarea cu un factor numar intreg, precum 2x, 3x, 4x "
"etc. Aceasta optiune scaleaza imaginea pana la cel mai mare factor intreg "
"sub rezolutia setata. Astfel, de exemplu, daca setati rezolutia pe ecran "
"complet la 1920x1080 si activati scalarea intreaga, o imagine de 320x240 va "
"fi scalata doar pana la 1280x960, lasand margini negre de jur imprejur. "
"Acest lucru mentine un raport de pixeli 1:1 cu imaginea sursa originala, "
"astfel incat pixelii sa nu fie duplicati inegal."

msgid ""
"Shaders are like filters for the game rendering. You can select a shader set "
"here, which is a collection of shaders selected for each system. You can "
"also change the shader within the game with HOTKEY + L2 or HOTKEY + R2."
msgstr ""
"Shaderele sunt ca niste filtre pentru randarea jocului. Puteti selecta aici "
"un set de shadere, care este o colectie de shadere selectate pentru fiecare "
"sistem. Puteti schimba de asemenea shaderul in joc cu HOTKEY + L2 sau HOTKEY "
"+ R2."

msgid "Enable or disable RetroAchievements in games."
msgstr "Activati sau dezactivati RetroAchievements in jocuri."

msgid ""
"Hardcore mode disables *all* savestate and rewind functions within the "
"emulator: you will not be able to save and reload at any time. You will have "
"to complete the game and get the achievements first time, just like on the "
"original console. In reward for this, you will earn both the standard and "
"the hardcore achievement, in effect earning double points! A regular game "
"worth 400 points, is now worth 800 if you complete it on hardcore! For "
"example: if you complete the game for 400 points, you then have the "
"opportunity to earn another 400 on hardcore."
msgstr ""
"Modul hardcore dezactiveaza *toate* functiile de salvare a starii si "
"derulare inapoi din emulator: nu veti putea salva si reincarca in niciun "
"moment. Va trebui sa terminati jocul si sa obtineti realizarile din prima "
"incercare, exact ca pe consola originala. Ca rasplata, veti castiga atat "
"realizarea standard cat si cea hardcore, obtinand astfel puncte duble! Un "
"joc obisnuit care valoreaza 400 de puncte valoreaza acum 800 daca il "
"terminati pe hardcore! De exemplu: daca terminati jocul pentru 400 de "
"puncte, aveti apoi ocazia sa castigati inca 400 pe hardcore."

msgid ""
"Configure an associated controller. Your controller has to be associated / "
"plugged before."
msgstr ""
"Configurati un controller asociat. Controllerul dvs. trebuie sa fie asociat/"
"conectat in prealabil."

msgid ""
"Pair a bluetooth controller with your recalbox. Your controller must be in "
"pairing mode."
msgstr ""
"Asociati un controller bluetooth cu recalbox-ul dvs. Controllerul trebuie sa "
"fie in modul de asociere."

msgid ""
"Forget all paired bluetooth controllers. You will have to pair your "
"controllers again, but this option can help if you have issues to reconnect "
"a controller, which is already paired."
msgstr ""
"Uitati toate controllerele bluetooth asociate. Va trebui sa asociati din nou "
"controllerele, dar aceasta optiune poate ajuta daca aveti probleme la "
"reconectarea unui controller deja asociat."

msgid ""
"Configure your EmulationStation experience. Select transition types, help "
"prompts, screensaver behavior. You can also deactivate the onscreen keyboard "
"if you have a real keyboard plugged into your recalbox.\n"
"If you've added games since the last boot, you can also refresh the gamelist "
"from this menu."
msgstr ""
"Configurati experienta EmulationStation. Selectati tipurile de tranzitie, "
"indicatiile de ajutor, comportamentul economizorului de ecran. Puteti "
"dezactiva de asemenea tastatura de pe ecran daca aveti o tastatura reala "
"conectata la recalbox.\n"
"Daca ati adaugat jocuri de la ultima pornire, puteti de asemenea "
"reimprospata lista de jocuri din acest meniu."

msgid "Configure screensaver"
msgstr "Configurati economizorul de ecran"

msgid "Start the screensaver after N minutes."
msgstr "Porniti economizorul de ecran dupa N minute."

msgid ""
"Set the screensaver behavior. DIM will reduce the screen light, BLACK will "
"turn the screen black, DEMO will launch demo mode."
msgstr ""
"Setati comportamentul economizorului de ecran. DIM va reduce lumina "
"ecranului, NEGRU va face ecranul negru, DEMO va lansa modul demo."

msgid ""
"Shows a help at the bottom of the screen which displays commands you can use."
msgstr ""
"Afiseaza un ajutor in partea de jos a ecranului care arata comenzile pe care "
"le puteti folosi."

msgid ""
"When enabled, you can switch between systems while browsing a gamelist by "
"pressing LEFT or RIGHT."
msgstr ""
"Cand este activat, puteti comuta intre sisteme in timp ce navigati o lista "
"de jocuri apasand STANGA sau DREAPTA."

msgid "Choose if carousel will be animated or not during transitions"
msgstr "Alegeti daca carusel va fi animat sau nu in timpul tranzitiilor"

msgid "Select a theme for your recalbox."
msgstr "Selectati o tema pentru recalbox-ul dvs."

msgid "Updates the gamelists, if you added games since the last boot."
msgstr ""
"Actualizeaza listele de jocuri, daca ati adaugat jocuri de la ultima pornire."

msgid "Configure the sound options of your recalbox."
msgstr "Configurati optiunile de sunet ale recalbox-ului dvs."

msgid "Set the volume of the sound output for the frontend and the games."
msgstr "Setati volumul iesirii audio pentru interfata si jocuri."

msgid "Select your output device. Only HDMI and JACK are supported."
msgstr "Selectati dispozitivul de iesire. Sunt suportate doar HDMI si JACK."

msgid ""
"Configure the network options of your recalbox.\n"
"Check your network status and IP address, set the hostname and configure the "
"WIFI."
msgstr ""
"Configurati optiunile de retea ale recalbox-ului dvs.\n"
"Verificati starea retelei si adresa IP, setati numele gazdei si configurati "
"WIFI."

msgid ""
"Displays CONNECTED, if you are connected, by checking if your recalbox can "
"access the recalbox.com update server."
msgstr ""
"Afiseaza CONECTAT, daca sunteti conectat, verificand daca recalbox-ul poate "
"accesa serverul de actualizare recalbox.com."

msgid "The IP address of your recalbox within your local network."
msgstr "Adresa IP a recalbox-ului dvs. in reteaua locala."

msgid ""
"Enable or disable WIFI.\n"
"If you disable WIFI, the SSID and the WIFI passwords are saved and can be "
"used when you reactivate it"
msgstr ""
"Activati sau dezactivati WIFI.\n"
"Daca dezactivati WIFI, SSID-ul si parolele WIFI sunt salvate si pot fi "
"folosite cand il reactivati"

msgid "The name of your recalbox in your local network"
msgstr "Numele recalbox-ului dvs. in reteaua locala"

msgid "SSID (WIFI Name) of your network."
msgstr "SSID (numele WIFI) al retelei dvs."

msgid "Private key of your WIFI network."
msgstr "Cheia privata a retelei dvs. WIFI."

msgid ""
"Get information and visuals for your games. The scraper downloads metadata "
"and visuals for your games from different servers, and greatly enhances the "
"user experience in EmulationStation."
msgstr ""
"Obtineti informatii si vizualuri pentru jocurile dvs. Verificatorul descarca "
"metadate si vizualuri pentru jocurile dvs. de pe diferite servere si "
"imbunatateste complet experienta utilizatorului in EmulationStation."

msgid ""
"Select a server to scrape from. The SCREENSCRAPER server is recommended and "
"is based on www.screenscraper.fr and scrapes game data in your language, if "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Selectati un server de pe care sa verificati. Serverul SCREENSCRAPER este "
