"alte butoane in majoritatea emulatoarelor.\n"
"De exemplu, puteti folosi HOTKEY+START pentru a iesi din jocul curent.\n"
"\n"
"Apasati butonul SELECT."

msgid ""
"Next to the SELECT button is the START button, marked with an 'II'.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"Langa butonul SELECT este butonul START, marcat cu 'II'.\n"
"Folositi-l pentru a deschide meniul principal in interfata Recalbox si "
"folositi-l in joc ca butonul START obisnuit disponibil pe majoritatea "
"consolelor.\n"
"\n"
"Va rugam apasati acest buton START."

msgid ""
"Then, there are 2 buttons marked with a 'III' and a 'IV'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press either volume up or down (III/IV)."
msgstr ""
"Apoi, exista 2 butoane marcate cu 'III' si 'IV'.\n"
"Folositi-le pentru a creste sau scadea volumul oricand in interfata Recalbox "
"sau in joc.\n"
"\n"
" Apasati fie volum sus fie volum jos (III/IV)."

msgid ""
"The last two buttons marked 'V' and 'VI' are useful to make your screen "
"darker or brighter.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down (V/VI)."
msgstr ""
"Ultimele doua butoane marcate 'V' si 'VI' sunt utile pentru a face ecranul "
"mai intunecat sau mai luminos.\n"
"Retineti ca cu cat ecranul este mai luminos, cu atat consuma mai multa "
"energie!\n"
"\n"
"Apasati fie luminozitate sus fie luminozitate jos (V/VI)."

msgid ""
"Now you're ready to start your RETROGAMING experience with Recalbox! Press "
"button B to start... and PLAY AGAIN!"
msgstr ""
"Acum sunteti gata sa incepeti experienta dvs. RETROGAMING cu Recalbox! "
"Apasati butonul B pentru a incepe... si JUCATI DIN NOU!"

msgid "WELCOME TO RECALBOX!"
msgstr "BINE ATI VENIT LA RECALBOX!"

msgid ""
"Just a few words about the POWER button.\n"
"Make a short press, just like a mouse click, and your console will enter "
"sleep mode. Make another short press and your console will restart instanly! "
"Work in Recalbox interface and in-game!\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"Doar cateva cuvinte despre butonul POWER.\n"
"Apasati scurt, ca un clic de mouse, si consola va intra in modul de repaus. "
"Apasati din nou scurt si consola va reporni instant! Functioneaza in "
"interfata Recalbox si in joc!\n"
"\n"
"Apasati butonul B pentru a continua."

msgid ""
"If you push the POWER button more than 2 seconds, this will power-off your "
"console. If you do so in-game, Recalbox will close the current emulator "
"gracefully.\n"
"Just in case, holding the POWER button down more than 5s perform an hard "
"power-off.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"Daca apasati butonul POWER mai mult de 2 secunde, aceasta va opri consola. "
"Daca faceti acest lucru in joc, Recalbox va inchide emulatorul curent in mod "
"elegant.\n"
"Pentru orice eventualitate, tinerea apasata a butonului POWER mai mult de 5s "
"efectueaza o oprire fortata.\n"
"\n"
"Apasati butonul B pentru a continua."

msgid ""
"One more thing to know: If you plug in or unplug your headphones in the jack "
"connector, Recalbox will automatically switch the audio output. Convenient.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Inca un lucru de stiut: daca conectati sau deconectati castile in mufa jack, "
"Recalbox va comuta automat iesirea audio. Convenabil.\n"
"\n"
"Apasati butonul B, ca de obicei."

