msgstr "RULEAZA CU"

msgid ""
"Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Super!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use all the special buttons "
"available all around the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr ""
"Bine ati venit la RECALBOX pentru Odroid Go Super!\n"
"Aceasta scurta prezentare va va arata cum sa folositi toate butoanele "
"speciale disponibile in jurul ecranului.\n"
"\n"
"Apasati orice buton pentru a incepe!"

msgid ""
"The top-left black button is the SELECT button, also available on most "
"modern pads.\n"
"But it is also the HOTKEY button that you can use in conjunction with other "
"buttons in most emulators.\n"
"For example, you can use HOTKEY+START to quit the current game.\n"
"\n"
"Press the SELECT button."
msgstr ""
"Butonul negru din stanga sus este butonul SELECT, disponibil de asemenea pe "
"majoritatea controllerelor moderne.\n"
"Dar este de asemenea butonul HOTKEY pe care il puteti folosi impreuna cu "
"alte butoane in majoritatea emulatoarelor.\n"
"De exemplu, puteti folosi HOTKEY+START pentru a iesi din jocul curent.\n"
"\n"
"Apasati butonul SELECT."

msgid ""
"At the opposite side of the SELECT button is the START button.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"De partea opusa a butonului SELECT este butonul START.\n"
"Folositi-l pentru a deschide meniul principal in interfata Recalbox si "
"folositi-l in joc ca butonul START obisnuit disponibil pe majoritatea "
"consolelor.\n"
"\n"
"Va rugam apasati acest buton START."

msgid ""
"Then, on the top of the console, there are 2 buttons marked with a '-' and a "
"'+'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press any button to continue"
msgstr ""
"Apoi, in partea de sus a consolei, exista 2 butoane marcate cu '-' si '+'.\n"
"Folositi-le pentru a creste sau scadea volumul oricand in interfata Recalbox "
"sau in joc.\n"
"\n"
" Apasati orice buton pentru a continua"

msgid ""
"The two bottom-left gray buttons control the screen brightness.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down button"
msgstr ""
"Cele doua butoane gri din stanga jos controleaza luminozitatea ecranului.\n"
"Retineti ca cu cat ecranul este mai luminos, cu atat consuma mai multa "
"energie!\n"
"\n"
" Apasati fie butonul de luminozitate sus fie jos"

msgid ""
"Finally, the two bottom-right gray buttons are third left & right triggers "
"(L3/R3), only usefull in some emulators or to record videos.\n"
"\n"
" Press either L3 or R3"
msgstr ""
"In final, cele doua butoane gri din dreapta jos sunt al treilea trigger "
"stanga si dreapta (L3/R3), utile doar in unele emulatoare sau pentru a "
"inregistra videoclipuri.\n"
"\n"
" Apasati fie L3 fie R3"

msgid ""
"Change the driver if your pad is not working at all or not working properly "
"in-game."
msgstr ""
"Schimbati driverul daca controllerul dvs. nu functioneaza deloc sau nu "
"functioneaza corect in joc."

