"Hello %NAME%, your private key is linked to a Patreon account which is no "
"longer a Recalbox Patron.\n"
"We still hope to see you back soon as a Recalbox Patron!\n"
"Delete your private key to suppress this message."
msgstr ""
"Buna %NAME%, cheia dvs. privata este legata de un cont Patreon care nu mai "
"este patron Recalbox.\n"
"Speram totusi sa va revedem curand ca patron Recalbox!\n"
"Stergeti cheia privata pentru a elimina acest mesaj."

msgid ""
"Your private key does not allow to retrieve your Patreon information. Go to "
"recalbox.com/patreon to generate a new valid key!"
msgstr ""
"Cheia dvs. privata nu permite recuperarea informatiilor dvs. Patreon. "
"Mergeti la recalbox.com/patreon pentru a genera o noua cheie valida!"

msgid ""
"Sorry we're not able to retrieve your Patron level because no network is "
"available!"
msgstr ""
"Ne pare rau, nu putem recupera nivelul dvs. de patron deoarece nu este "
"disponibila nicio retea!"

msgid ""
"We're not able to retrieve your Patron level! Sorry for the inconvenience, "
"we're already working on a fix!"
msgstr ""
"Nu putem recupera nivelul dvs. de patron! Ne cerem scuze pentru neplaceri, "
"lucram deja la o solutie!"

