"The temperature of your system is high.\n"
"The system may slow down. Try cooling your Raspberry Pi with a fan or "
"disable overclock if it's enabled."
msgstr ""
"Temperatura sistemului dvs. este ridicata.\n"
"Sistemul se poate incetini. Incercati sa raciti Raspberry Pi-ul cu un "
"ventilator sau dezactivati suprasolicitarea daca este activata."

msgid ""
"Choose strategy\n"
"\n"
"AUTO: auto apply default patch\n"
"\n"
"LAUNCH LAST: always launch the last one (can be modified in edit game menu)\n"
"\n"
"SELECT: choose manually which patch to apply. Default one or patches in "
"[ROM_NAME]-patches directory\n"
"\n"
"DISABLED: never apply patch"
msgstr ""
"Alegeti strategia\n"
"\n"
"AUTO: aplica automat patch-ul implicit\n"
"\n"
"LANSEAZA ULTIMUL: lanseaza mereu ultimul (poate fi modificat in meniul de "
"editare a jocului)\n"
"\n"
"SELECTEAZA: alegeti manual ce patch sa aplicati. Cel implicit sau patch-"
"urile din directorul [ROM_NAME]-patches\n"
"\n"
"DEZACTIVAT: nu aplica niciodata patch"

