msgid ""
"You can navigate through the menus using the directional pad, **select a "
"system**, or start a game with the **B button**. The **A button** allows you "
"to exit a menu or game list.\n"
"\n"
"Access the **main menu** using the **START button**.\n"
"To exit a game, press the SELECT and START buttons simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Puteti naviga prin meniuri folosind crucea directionala, **selectati un "
"sistem**, sau porniti un joc cu **butonul B**. **Butonul A** va permite sa "
"iesiti dintr-un meniu sau lista de jocuri.\n"
"\n"
"Accesati **meniul principal** folosind **butonul START**.\n"
"Pentru a iesi dintr-un joc, apasati simultan butoanele SELECT si START."

msgid "RGB JAMMA 2"
msgstr "RGB JAMMA 2"

msgid ""
"You can navigate through the menus using the joystick, **select a system**, "
"or start a game with the **button 1**. The **button 2** allows you to exit a "
"menu or game list.\n"
"\n"
"Access the **main menu** using the **START button**.\n"
"To **exit a game**, **press and hold START** for 4 seconds and release."
msgstr ""
"Puteti naviga prin meniuri folosind joystick-ul, **selectati un sistem**, "
"sau porniti un joc cu **butonul 1**. **Butonul 2** va permite sa iesiti "
"dintr-un meniu sau lista de jocuri.\n"
"\n"
"Accesati **meniul principal** folosind **butonul START**.\n"
"Pentru a **iesi dintr-un joc**, **apasati si tineti START** timp de 4 "
"secunde si eliberati."

msgid "RGB DUAL 2"
msgstr "RGB DUAL 2"

msgid ""
"Your Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 has been detected and installed automatically! You "
"can now enjoy **all your games** on Recalbox with **perfect pixels and "
"frequency**!"
msgstr ""
"Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 al dvs. a fost detectat si instalat automat! Puteti acum "
"sa va bucurati de **toate jocurile dvs.** pe Recalbox cu **pixeli si "
"frecventa perfecte**!"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Consider this: you can automatically switch back to **HDMI mode** by "
"connecting an HDMI cable and restarting Recalbox!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Retineti: puteti reveni automat la **modul HDMI** conectand un cablu HDMI si "
"repornind Recalbox!"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"An HDMI cable has been detected and the “HDMI priority” mode is enabled in "
"the options. To switch back to CRT mode, disconnect the HDMI cable and "
"restart, or disable the HDMI priority option in the Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 "
"(START) menu options."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Un cablu HDMI a fost detectat si modul “prioritate HDMI” este activat in "
"optiuni. Pentru a reveni la modul CRT, deconectati cablul HDMI si reporniti, "
"sau dezactivati optiunea de prioritate HDMI in optiunile meniului Recalbox "
"RGB DUAL 2 (START)."

msgid "Recalbox Card Reader"
msgstr "Cititor de carduri Recalbox"

msgid ""
"Your Recalbox Card Reader has been detected and **installed automatically!"
"**\n"
"\n"
"You can start using it right away by **inserting a card** into the reader "
"and going to the game of your choice to **associate the game and card** "
"using the **menu** available with the **START** button."
msgstr ""
"Cititorul de carduri Recalbox al dvs. a fost detectat si **instalat automat!"
"**\n"
"\n"
"Puteti incepe sa il folositi imediat **introducand un card** in cititor si "
"mergand la jocul ales pentru a **asocia jocul si cardul** folosind "
"**meniul** disponibil cu butonul **START**."

msgid "Add games"
msgstr "Adauga jocuri"

msgid ""
"Recalbox shares its ROM, BIOS, and save files folders on the local network. "
"Adding your ROMs couldn't be easier: on your computer, search for your "
"“recalbox” in the network shares.\n"
"Go to the ROMs folder, then copy your game to the folder corresponding to "
"its system. For example, to add a “NES” game, copy it to the ‘roms/nes’ "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Recalbox partajeaza folderele sale de ROM, BIOS si fisiere de salvare in "
"reteaua locala. Adaugarea ROM-urilor nu poate fi mai usoara: pe computerul "
"dvs., cautati “recalbox” in partajarile de retea.\n"
"Mergeti la folderul ROM-uri, apoi copiati jocul in folderul corespunzator "
"sistemului sau. De exemplu, pentru a adauga un joc “NES”, copiati-l in "
"folderul ‘roms/nes’."

msgid ""
"Remember to connect your Recalbox to the internet to enjoy all its "
